# First Things First

This is my first time creating a GitHub repository, and probably the first time I have tried to gather, organize, and document everything I have learned and experienced over the past half year in one place.

I am writing this at the very beginning because I know this project is going to be challenging for me, but I also know that I do not want to give up on it. I want to put my heart into this work and build something meaningful.

As a somewhat obsessive perfectionist, I know I will care deeply about the quality of the final result. I also know that this process will take a lot of time, energy, and patience from me. But in the end, I believe it will be worth it.
